* Bundling with paid products or services.
* Monetizing distribution or access in any form.

Exceptions: This restriction does not prohibit free distribution, open-source sharing, or the receipt of voluntary financial donations (such as tips, Ko-fi, or Patreon support), provided that such donations are strictly optional and do not restrict, delay, time-gate, or block access to the Software, Mods, updates, or specific features.

3. Mod Requirements
